{
  "name": "Qualify B2B Leads by Website Tech Stack, Ad Pixels & DNS SaaS Signals",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`website-tech-stack-ad-pixels-and-saas-detector`).\n2. Create a Generic Header Auth credential named **RapidAPI Key** (`x-rapidapi-key`).\n3. Replace the sample domains in **Set Prospect Domains** (or connect a Google Sheets / HubSpot trigger).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "49f03d2a-712f-40a5-8130-13cce6363ada",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why This Works on Enterprise Domains\n- Even when a domain returns HTTP 403 (WAF), `POST /scan` still returns `verifiedDnsSaaS` and `emailProvider` via MX/TXT/DMARC.\n- Publisher ad scripts (AdSense/GPT) are excluded from `hasAdPixels` so only true paid advertisers route to Sales.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "1b8acba6-9da5-4cdd-92ce-59478d813d88",
      "name": "WAF-Resilient Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e304ed87-5e3f-4e93-944f-58459b0d5526",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "14a87419-f24b-49b2-aad2-9eff7de288fd",
              "name": "domains",
              "value": "={{ ['posthog.com', 'stripe.com', 'zillow.com', 'hubspot.com'] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c548b093-11ac-44ad-a52f-92f4abe1a023",
      "name": "Set Prospect Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://website-tech-stack-ad-pixels-and-saas-detector.p.rapidapi.com/scan",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-rapidapi-host",
              "value": "website-tech-stack-ad-pixels-and-saas-detector.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: $json.domains }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "a0807a79-fd49-4338-ba0e-6f82f0577c3e",
      "name": "Scan Tech Stack, Pixels & DNS SaaS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        60
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "items",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "87f11418-eca4-405c-9e25-d48e3e8c7cc7",
      "name": "Split Out Scanned Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "de2c6aee-2009-4642-87f6-d264daeac91c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hasAdPixels }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "5cc0dcb5-bf6c-408f-8889-915622bfd0b7",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.verifiedDnsSaaS || []).length }}",
              "rightValue": 3,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        }
      },
      "id": "127c6c21-97ca-4791-9532-816026f76df8",
      "name": "Filter Qualified B2B Prospects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "2d410955-5b1e-4b4d-8a0f-cbbaf388d032",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ec7f2a1b-97ef-48ae-a08f-b487b7a32418",
              "name": "scanStatus",
              "value": "={{ $json.scanStatus }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f77e92c3-c948-4678-88fc-66a01970af7b",
              "name": "adPlatforms",
              "value": "={{ ($json.adPlatforms || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5f914c1a-f4cf-4a18-a90d-680c7554b832",
              "name": "emailProvider",
              "value": "={{ $json.emailProvider || 'Unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5f143c5d-871b-48a0-91bf-d296d343d6aa",
              "name": "dnsSaaS",
              "value": "={{ ($json.verifiedDnsSaaS || []).slice(0, 8).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3d5aa5ea-8da8-4c62-9820-d26de5b0b624",
      "name": "Format Technographic Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#sales-signals"
        },
        "text": "={{ 'Qualified Account: ' + $json.domain + ' | Ads: ' + ($json.adPlatforms || 'None') + ' | Mail: ' + $json.emailProvider + ' | DNS SaaS: ' + $json.dnsSaaS }}"
      },
      "id": "965de3a9-5660-46fc-b0fd-2b22dba47d16",
      "name": "Notify Sales Channel on Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
